Beszel Agent plugin for OPNsense.

Provides a web-based interface to configure and manage the Beszel Agent,
a lightweight server monitoring agent that connects to a Beszel Hub instance.

Features:
- Enable/disable the Beszel Agent service
- Configure connection settings (Hub URL, port, public key, token)
- View service logs in real-time

WWW: https://github.com/henrygd/beszel
